flowchart TD
  Client[Client Application] --> Gateway[API Gateway]
  Gateway --> ObjStore[(Object Storage)]
  Gateway --> NLParser[LLM Query Parser]
  Gateway --> VisionEnc[Multimodal Vision Service]
  Gateway --> StagingWorker[Visual Staging Service]

  NLParser --> RecsEngine[Hybrid Recommendation Engine]
  VisionEnc --> RecsEngine

  RecsEngine --> VectorDB[(Vector Database)]
  RecsEngine --> CatalogDB[(Product Catalog DB)]
  RecsEngine --> Gateway

  StagingWorker --> ObjStore

  ScrapeQueue[Scraper Task Queue] --> ScrapeWorkers[Catalog Ingestion Workers]
  ScrapeWorkers --> CatalogDB
  ScrapeWorkers --> VectorDB
  ScrapeWorkers --> ObjStore